WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.802
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW recomputes the stored result from the underlying query.

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:08.922
Run this after creating the stale condition.

00:00:08.922 --> 00:00:12.742
The Influenza count should now match the current base data.

00:00:12.742 --> 00:00:19.042
The refreshed-at value should also be recomputed, documenting the new snapshot time.

00:00:19.042 --> 00:00:24.427
A standard view stores a query definition, not a separate copy of the rows.

00:00:24.427 --> 00:00:31.687
Treat the selected columns, names, types, and grain as a contract with downstream users.

00:00:31.687 --> 00:00:38.277
Changing that contract can break dashboards or applications even if the underlying query still runs.
